00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.700
Have a great weekend, everyone.

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:42.780
Thank you very much.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.020
See you, from Berlin.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.840
